    "AI-powered assistant that can analyze files, images, and provide conversational help. Use Cmd+Shift+A to quickly access the assistant." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "KI-gestützter Assistent, der Dateien und Bilder analysieren und Ihnen im Dialog weiterhelfen kann. Mit Cmd+Shift+A können Sie schnell auf den Assistenten zugreifen."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Un assistant IA qui peut analyser des fichiers, des images, et fournir une aide conversationnelle. Utiliser Cmd+Maj+A pour y accéder facilement."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "파일과 이미지를 분석하고 대화형 도움말을 제공하는 AI 지원 어시스턴트입니다. Cmd+Shift+A를 눌러 어시스턴트에 빠르게 접근할 수 있습니다."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AI-aangedreven assistent die bestanden en afbeeldingen kan analyseren en gesprekshulp kan bieden. Gebruik Cmd+Shift+A om snel toegang te krijgen tot de assistent."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Assistente alimentado por IA que pode analisar arquivos, imagens e fornecer ajuda de conversação. Use Cmd+Shift+A para acessar rapidamente o assistente."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ИИ-помощник для анализа файлов, изображений и ведения диалога. Нажмите Cmd+Shift+A для быстрого доступа."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ผู้ช่วยที่ขับเคลื่อนด้วย AI สามารถวิเคราะห์ไฟล์ รูปภาพ และให้ความช่วยเหลือแบบสนทนา ใช้ Cmd+Shift+A เพื่อเข้าถึงผู้ช่วยอย่างรวดเร็ว"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dosyaları, görüntüleri analiz edebilen ve konuşma yardımı sağlayabilen yapay zeka destekli asistan. Asistana hızlı bir şekilde erişmek için Cmd+Shift+A tuşlarını kullanın."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AI 驱动的助手，可分析文件和图像并提供对话式帮助。使用 Cmd+Shift+A 快速访问。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
