          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tam Disk Erişimi gerekli"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "需要完全磁盘访问权限"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Full Disk Access unlocks custom Focus icons, colors, and labels. Standard Focus detection still works without it—grant access only if you need personalized indicators." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "전체 디스크 접근 권한을 허용하면 사용자 지정 집중 모드 아이콘, 색상 및 레이블을 사용할 수 있습니다. 권한이 없어도 표준 집중 모드 감지는 정상적으로 작동하므로, 개인화된 표시기가 필요한 경우에만 권한을 허용하십시오."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Volledige schijftoegang ontgrendelt aangepaste Focus-pictogrammen, kleuren en labels. Standaard Focus-detectie werkt ook zonder. Verleen alleen toegang als je gepersonaliseerde indicatoren nodig hebt."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Full Disk Access ปลดล็อกไอคอน สี และป้ายกำกับโฟกัสกำหนดเอง การตรวจจับโฟกัสมาตรฐานยังทำงานโดยไม่ต้องมี — ให้สิทธิ์เฉพาะเมื่อต้องการตัวบ่งชี้ส่วนตัว"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tam Disk Erişimi, özel Odak simgelerinin, renklerinin ve etiketlerinin kilidini açar. Standart Odak tespiti bu özellik olmadan da çalışır; yalnızca kişiselleştirilmiş göstergelere ihtiyacınız varsa erişim izni verin."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "完全磁盘访问解锁自定义专注模式图标、颜色和标签。标准专注检测无需此权限即可工作——仅在需要个性化指示器时授予访问权限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
