    "Option as Meta sends Esc+key instead of macOS special characters. Mouse reporting forwards mouse events to terminal applications like vim or tmux." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "'Option을 Meta 키로 사용'을 선택하면 macOS 특수 문자 대신 Esc+키를 전송합니다. '마우스 리포팅'은 마우스 이벤트를 vim이나 tmux 같은 터미널 애플리케이션으로 전달합니다."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Optie omdat Meta Esc+key verzendt in plaats van speciale macOS-tekens. Muisrapportage stuurt muisgebeurtenissen door naar terminaltoepassingen zoals vim of tmux."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Option как Meta отправляет Esc+клавишу вместо спецсимволов."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Option เป็น Meta ส่ง Esc+ปุ่ม แทนอักขระพิเศษ macOS การรายงานเมาส์ส่งต่อเหตุการณ์เมาส์ไปยังแอปเทอร์มินัลเช่น vim หรือ tmux"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Meta seçeneği, macOS özel karakterleri yerine Esc+tuşunu gönderir. Fare raporlaması, fare olaylarını vim veya tmux gibi terminal uygulamalarına iletir."
          }
        }
      }
    },
