    "Panel mode shows clipboard in a floating window near the notch." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the \"Panel\" clipboard display mode.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "패널 모드는 노치 근처의 플로팅 윈도우에 클립보드를 표시합니다."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "De paneelmodus toont het klembord in een zwevend venster nabij de inkeping."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "O modo painel mostra a área de transferência em uma janela flutuante perto do notch."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Панель"
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "โหมดแผงแสดงคลิปบอร์ดในหน้าต่างลอยใกล้รอยบาก"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Panel modu, panoyu çentiğin yakınında kayan bir pencerede gösterir."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Panel mode shows color picker in a floating window. Popover mode shows color picker as a dropdown attached to the color picker button." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "패널 모드는 플로팅 윈도우에 색상 선택기를 표시합니다. 팝오버 모드는 색상 선택기 버튼에 연결된 드롭다운 형식으로 색상 선택기를 표시합니다."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Paneelmodus toont de kleurkiezer in een zwevend venster. De popover-modus toont de kleurkiezer als een vervolgkeuzelijst die aan de kleurkiezerknop is gekoppeld."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "O modo painel mostra o seletor de cores em uma janela flutuante. O modo popover mostra o seletor de cores como um menu suspenso anexado ao botão do seletor de cores."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Режим \"Панель\" показывает пипетку в отдельном окне. Всплывающее окно – возле кнопки."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "โหมดแผงแสดงตัวเลือกสีในหน้าต่างลอย โหมดป๊อปโอเวอร์แสดงตัวเลือกสีเป็นดรอปดาวน์ติดกับปุ่มตัวเลือกสี"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Panel modu, yüzen bir pencerede renk seçiciyi gösterir. Açılır pencere modu, renk seçici düğmesine bağlı bir açılır menü olarak renk seçiciyi gösterir."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Panel mode shows the assistant in a floating window near the notch. Popover mode shows the assistant as a dropdown attached to the AI button." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "패널 모드는 노치 근처의 플로팅 윈도우에 어시스턴트를 표시합니다. 팝오버 모드는 AI 버튼에 연결된 드롭다운 형식으로 어시스턴트를 표시합니다."
          }
