    "Presets show up inside the timer popover with the configured name, duration, and accent colour. Reorder them to change the display order." : {
      "comment" : "A footer for the \"Timer Presets\" section in the TimerSettings view, explaining how to manage and reorder timer presets.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "프리셋은 설정된 이름, 시간 및 강조 색상과 함께 타이머 팝오버 안에 표시됩니다. 표시 순서를 바꾸려면 항목을 재정렬하세요."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Voorinstellingen verschijnen in de timer-popover met de geconfigureerde naam, duur en accentkleur. Herschik ze om de weergavevolgorde te wijzigen."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
