    "Select a custom sound to play when a timer ends. Supported formats include MP3, M4A, WAV, and AIFF." : {
      "comment" : "A description below the option to select a custom timer sound.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "타이머가 종료될 때 재생할 사용자 지정 사운드를 선택하세요. 지원되는 형식은 MP3, M4A, WAV, AIFF입니다."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Selecteer een aangepast geluid om af te spelen wanneer een timer afloopt. Ondersteunde formaten zijn onder meer MP3, M4A, WAV en AIFF."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Selecione um som personalizado para reproduzir quando um cronômetro terminar. Os formatos suportados incluem MP3, M4A, WAV e AIFF."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Выберите звук для окончания таймера. Поддерживаются MP3, M4A, WAV и AIFF."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "เลือกเสียงกำหนดเองเพื่อเล่นเมื่อตัวจับเวลาหมด รองรับ MP3, M4A, WAV และ AIFF"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zamanlayıcı sona erdiğinde çalmak için özel bir ses seçin. Desteklenen formatlar arasında MP3, M4A, WAV ve AIFF bulunur."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "选择计时器结束时播放的自定义声音。支持格式包括 MP3、M4A、WAV 和 AIFF。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
