    "Separate Tab mode integrates Copied Items and Notes into a single view. If both are enabled, Notes appear on the right and Clipboard on the left." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the \"Separate Tab\" clipboard display mode.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "'별도 탭' 모드는 복사된 항목과 메모를 하나의 뷰로 통합합니다. 두 기능이 모두 활성화된 경우 메모는 오른쪽에, 클립보드는 왼쪽에 표시됩니다."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "De aparte tabbladmodus integreert gekopieerde items en notities in één enkele weergave. Als beide zijn ingeschakeld, verschijnen Notities aan de rechterkant en het Klembord aan de linkerkant."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "O modo Abas Separadas integra Itens Copiados e Notas em uma única visualização. Se ambos estiverem ativados, o Notes aparecerá à direita e a Área de Transferência à esquerda."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Отдельная вкладка"
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "โหมด Separate Tab รวมรายการที่คัดลอกและบันทึกในมุมมองเดียว หากเปิดทั้งสอง บันทึกอยู่ด้านขวา คลิปบอร์ดอยู่ด้านซ้าย"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ayrı Sekme modu, Kopyalanan Öğeleri ve Notları tek bir görünümde birleştirir. Her ikisi de etkinse, sağda Notlar ve solda Pano görünür."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "独立标签页模式将复制项和笔记整合到单一视图中。如果两者都启用，笔记显示在右侧，剪贴板显示在左侧。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
