            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ปุ่มควบคุมสื่อรอยบากมาตรฐานถูกซ่อน เปิดใช้สวิตช์ด้านบนอีกครั้งเพื่อกู้คืน"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Standart çentikli medya kontrolleri gizlidir. Bunları geri yüklemek için yukarıdaki geçişi yeniden etkinleştirin."
