    "When bold-as-bright is off, bold text uses a heavier font weight instead of bright ANSI colors." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "'볼드체를 밝은 색으로 표시'가 꺼져 있으면, 볼드체 텍스트에 밝은 ANSI 색상 대신 더 두꺼운 폰트 굵기가 사용됩니다."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wanneer vet-zo-helder is uitgeschakeld, wordt bij vetgedrukte tekst een zwaarder lettertype gebruikt in plaats van heldere ANSI-kleuren."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Утолщенный шрифт 대신 ярких цветов ANSI."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "เมื่อปิดตัวหนาเป็นสว่าง ข้อความตัวหนาจะใช้น้ำหนักแบบอักษรที่หนักกว่าแทนสี ANSI สว่าง"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Parlak kadar kalın seçeneği kapalıyken, kalın metinde parlak ANSI renkleri yerine daha ağır bir yazı tipi ağırlığı kullanılır."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "关闭粗体变亮时，粗体文本使用更粗的字体而非明亮的 ANSI 颜色。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When disabled, all keyboard shortcuts will be inactive. You can still use the UI controls." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "비활성화하면 모든 키보드 단축키를 사용할 수 없습니다. UI 제어기는 계속 사용할 수 있습니다."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Indien uitgeschakeld, zijn alle sneltoetsen inactief. Je kunt de UI-bedieningselementen nog steeds gebruiken."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Quando desativado, todos os atalhos de teclado estarão inativos. Você ainda pode usar os controles da interface do usuário."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Когда параметр «Жирный текст как яркие цвета» отключён, он отображается более толстым начертанием шрифта вместо использования ярких ANSI-цветов."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "เมื่อปิดใช้ ทางลัดแป้นพิมพ์ทั้งหมดจะไม่ทำงาน คุณยังสามารถใช้ปุ่มควบคุม UI ได้"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Devre dışı bırakıldığında, tüm klavye kısayolları devre dışı bırakılacaktır. Kullanıcı arayüzü kontrollerini kullanmaya devam edebilirsiniz."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "禁用后，所有键盘快捷键将不可用。您仍然可以使用界面控制。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When disabled, the notch music player stays visible with placeholder metadata even when playback is inactive." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "비활성화시, 재생 중이 아닐 때도 기본 정보가 표시된 노치 음악 플레이어가 계속 유지됩니다."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Indien uitgeschakeld blijft de muziekspeler in de inkeping zichtbaar met tijdelijke metadata, zelfs als het afspelen inactief is."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "При отключении музыкальный плеер выреза остается видимым с пустыми данными даже без воспроизведения."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "เมื่อปิดใช้ เครื่องเล่นเพลงรอยบากจะยังแสดงพร้อมข้อมูลเมตาจำลองแม้เล่นไม่ได้อยู่"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Devre dışı bırakıldığında çentikli müzik çalar, oynatma etkin olmadığında bile yer tutucu meta verilerle birlikte görünür kalır."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "禁用时，刘海音乐播放器即使在未播放时也会显示占位元数据。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When enabled, clicking on calendar events will open the selected third-party calendar app instead of Apple Calendar." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "활성화하면 캘린더 이벤트를 클릭할 때 Apple 캘린더 대신 선택한 타사 캘린더 앱이 열립니다."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Als deze optie is ingeschakeld, wordt bij het klikken op agenda-items de geselecteerde agenda-app van een derde partij geopend in plaats van Apple Agenda."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "เมื่อเปิดใช้ การคลิกเหตุการณ์ปฏิทินจะเปิดแอปปฏิทินบุคคลที่สามที่เลือกแทน Apple Calendar"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Etkinleştirildiğinde, takvim etkinliklerine tıklandığında Apple Takvim yerine seçilen üçüncü taraf takvim uygulaması açılır."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When enabled, the music visualizer displays real-time audio spectrum data synced to your music. Requires macOS 14.2+ and uses minimal CPU/GPU resources via the Accelerate framework." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "활성화 시 음악 비주얼라이저가 음악에 동기화된 실시간 오디오 스펙트럼 데이터를 표시합니다. macOS 14.2 이상이 필요하며, Accelerate 프레임워크를 통해 최소한의 CPU/GPU 리소스만 사용합니다."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Als deze optie is ingeschakeld, toont de muziekvisualisatie realtime audiospectrumgegevens die met je muziek zijn gesynchroniseerd. Vereist macOS 14.2+ en gebruikt minimale CPU/GPU-bronnen via het Accelerate-framework."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "เมื่อเปิดใช้ ตัวแสดงผลเพลงจะแสดงข้อมูลสเปกตรัมเสียงแบบเรียลไทม์ซิงค์กับเพลง ต้องการ macOS 14.2+ และใช้ทรัพยากร CPU/GPU น้อยผ่าน Accelerate framework"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Etkinleştirildiğinde, müzik görselleştirici müziğinizle senkronize edilmiş gerçek zamanlı ses spektrumu verilerini görüntüler. macOS 14.2+ gerektirir ve Accelerate çerçevesi aracılığıyla minimum CPU/GPU kaynaklarını kullanır."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "启用时，音乐可视化将显示与音乐同步的实时音频频谱数据。需要 macOS 14.2+，通过 Accelerate 框架使用最少的 CPU/GPU 资源。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When enabled, the notch slides up and hides on external (non-notch) displays until you hover over it." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the feature that hides the notch on non-notch displays.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "활성화 시, 노치가 없는 외부 디스플레이에서는 마우스를 올릴 때까지 노치가 위로 슬라이드되어 숨겨집니다."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Als deze optie is ingeschakeld, schuift de inkeping omhoog en verbergt die zich op externe beeldschermen zonder inkeping totdat je erover beweegt."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "При включении вырез скрывается на внешних дисплеях, пока вы не наведете курсор."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "เมื่อเปิดใช้ รอยบากจะเลื่อนขึ้นและซ่อนบนจอภายนอก (ที่ไม่ใช่รอยบาก) จนกว่าคุณจะชี้"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Etkinleştirildiğinde çentik yukarı kayar ve siz üzerine gelene kadar harici (çentiksiz) ekranlarda gizlenir."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "启用时，刘海在外接（无刘海）显示器上会向上滑动隐藏，直到您将鼠标悬停在上方。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When enabled, the Stats tab will display real-time system performance graphs. This feature requires system permissions and may use additional battery." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "활성화 시, 통계 탭에 실시간 시스템 성능 그래프가 표시됩니다. 이 기능은 시스템 권한이 필요하며 배터리를 추가로 소모할 수 있습니다."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Als deze optie is ingeschakeld, geeft het tabblad Statistieken realtime grafieken van systeemprestaties weer. Voor deze functie zijn systeemmachtigingen vereist en kan extra batterijgebruik worden gebruikt."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Quando ativada, a guia Estatísticas exibirá gráficos de desempenho do sistema em tempo real. Esse recurso requer permissões do sistema e pode usar bateria adicional."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "При включении, вырез на экране сдвигается вверх и скрывается на внешних (не имеющих выреза) дисплеях, пока вы не наведете на него курсор."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "เมื่อเปิดใช้ แท็บสถิติจะแสดงกราฟประสิทธิภาพระบบแบบเรียลไทม์ ฟีเจอร์นี้ต้องการสิทธิ์ระบบและอาจใช้แบตเตอรี่เพิ่มเติม"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Etkinleştirildiğinde, İstatistikler sekmesi gerçek zamanlı sistem performans grafiklerini gösterecektir. Bu özellik sistem izinleri gerektirir ve ek pil kullanabilir."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "启用后，统计标签页将显示实时系统性能图表。此功能需要系统权限，可能会消耗额外电量。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When enabled, the Stats tab will display real-time system performance graphs. This feature requires system permissions and may use additional battery. Enabling LLM Usage Monitor adds a Usage tab that tracks token usage and spend across your configured AI providers." : {

    },
    "Where scan snapshots are saved and read." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "الموضع الذي تُحفَظ فيه لقطات الفحص وتُقرأ منه."
          }
        },
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kam se ukládají a odkud se čtou snímky skenů."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wo Scan-Snapshots gespeichert und gelesen werden."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Where scan snapshots are saved and read."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dónde se guardan y se leen las instantáneas de los análisis."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Où les instantanés d’analyse sont enregistrés et lus."
          }
        },
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ide mentődnek, és innen olvasódnak a vizsgálati pillanatképek."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dove vengono salvati e letti gli snapshot delle scansioni."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "검사 스냅샷을 저장하고 읽는 위치입니다."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Waar momentopnamen van scans worden opgeslagen en gelezen."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Gdzie zapisywane i odczytywane są migawki skanów."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Onde os snapshots das verificações são salvos e lidos."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Где сохраняются и откуда читаются снимки сканирований."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ตำแหน่งที่บันทึกและอ่านสแนปชอตการสแกน"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tarama anlık görüntülerinin kaydedildiği ve okunduğu yer."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Де зберігаються й звідки читаються знімки сканувань."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "扫描快照的保存和读取位置。"
          }
        }
      }
